@startuml
title Destination Search and Information Module : View Destination Details

actor "Traveller" as Actor
participant UI as ":destinationDetails"
participant Ctrl as ":destinationController"
participant API as ":serpApiGoogleMapsAPI"

Actor -> UI: Select a destination
UI -> Ctrl: Request destination details
Ctrl -> API: retrieveDestinationDetails(destinationId)
API --> Ctrl: Destination details result

alt [Destination details are available]
    Ctrl --> UI: Display destination name, category, location, rating and available details
    UI --> Actor: Show available destination images and information
else [Destination details are incomplete]
    Ctrl --> UI: Display available destination information only
else [Destination details cannot be retrieved]
    Ctrl --> UI: Display unable to load destination details message
end
@enduml
